The add-on's settings were generated from a build without Vulkan, so they
lack Hardware (Vulkan) and the 18 options only the Vulkan renderer has, and
Kodi logs each missing option as an error when the core starts. Add them in
the form kodi-game-scripting writes, from the core's options at 7efcb4d7.

